the trainee to commit and push - documents are saved like code is."}, {"id": "skill_concept_problem_goal_objectives", "label": "Artifact: problem + goal + 3-5 objectives extracted from free-form speech", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/defining-mvp/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "skill_concept_scope_three_lists", "label": "Artifact: three scope lists - in scope, out of scope, future development plan", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/defining-mvp/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "skill_rule_scope_derived_from_definition", "label": "Rule: derive in-scope items from the 8.1 description, do not re-collect them", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/defining-mvp/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 2 blockquote", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The trainee's own description of his product's pages already is the scope list before it is formalised - which is why 8.2 depends on 8.1."}, {"id": "skill_check_problem_not_solution", "label": "Quality check: the problem must be a problem, not a solution", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/defining-mvp/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 1 quality table", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "'I want a booking app' describes a solution - step back and ask what goes wrong today without it."}, {"id": "skill_check_measurable_objectives", "label": "Quality check: objectives must be concrete - reject easy/fast/better without a metric", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/defining-mvp/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 1 quality table", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Never wave weak wording through out of politeness - naming an unmeasurable objective is a service to the trainee."}, {"id": "skill_warning_out_of_scope_never_empty", "label": "Warning: an empty out-of-scope list is the single most common mistake", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/defining-mvp/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 2 common mistakes", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Anything not explicitly ruled out comes back later as somebody's demand."}, {"id": "skill_rule_three_to_five_and_future_plan", "label": "Rule: keep 3-5 core areas; move the overflow to the future plan, not the bin", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/defining-mvp/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Do not refuse or delete unilaterally - order the list by closeness to the core journey and ask which one, if absent, makes the product meaningless. The real reason is finishing inside bootcamp time; say it plainly."}, {"id": "skill_mistake_goal_vs_scope_item", "label": "Mistake: confusing an objective (measured by impact) with a scope item (measured by being built); scope must not describe technologies", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/defining-mvp/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 2 common mistakes", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "'A database' is not a scope item - scope describes what the user does."}], "edges": [{"source": "skill_defining_mvp", "target": "skill_task_8_1_mvp_definition", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/defining-mvp/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 1